{
  "episode": 11,
  "source": "assets/video/ep11.mp4",
  "model": "base",
  "duration": 350.3659375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "text": "Journey to the West, Chapter 11, Trouble in Heaven."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 7.0,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "Erlang quickly tied up Wukong and brought him up to Heaven."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 27.0,
      "text": "I want some Wukong destroyed."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 27.0,
      "end": 31.0,
      "text": "Said the Jade Emperor."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 35.0,
      "text": "Soldiers tied Wukong to a pillar in a courtyard."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 40.0,
      "text": "They struck him with swords."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 40.0,
      "end": 43.0,
      "text": "But his body was as hard as a diamond."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 46.0,
      "text": "The swords shattered."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 48.0,
      "text": "Wukong laughed."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 48.0,
      "end": 51.0,
      "text": "Your swords can't hurt me."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 51.0,
      "end": 54.0,
      "text": "The Jade Emperor turned to a messenger."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 54.0,
      "end": 59.0,
      "text": "Bring in the fire gods."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 59.0,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "Several fire gods entered the courtyard and threw balls of flame at Wukong."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "The courtyard filled with smoke."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 74.0,
      "text": "But when the smoke cleared, not one hair on Wukong's body was burned."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 74.0,
      "end": 76.0,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 81.0,
      "text": "I was feeling a little cold."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 81.0,
      "end": 83.0,
      "text": "Gather the thunder gods."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 83.0,
      "end": 86.0,
      "text": "Said the Jade Emperor."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 86.0,
      "end": 90.0,
      "text": "Several thunder gods entered the courtyard."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 90.0,
      "end": 95.0,
      "text": "The Jade Emperor smiled as lightning bolt shot toward Wukong."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 95.0,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "But even the lightning couldn't harm the monkey."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 100.0,
      "text": "That tickled."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 100.0,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "Said Wukong with a smile."
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 107.0,
      "text": "The Jade Emperor shook his head."
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 107.0,
      "end": 110.0,
      "text": "It seems that Wukong can't be destroyed."
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 110.0,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "That's because he ate all the peaches."
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 114.0,
      "text": "Said Lausa."
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 114.0,
      "end": 118.0,
      "text": "Just one peach would make someone live forever."
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 118.0,
      "end": 121.0,
      "text": "He ate every peach in the garden."
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 121.0,
      "end": 123.0,
      "text": "The Emperor frowned."
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 123.0,
      "end": 125.0,
      "text": "Then how will we get rid of him?"
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 125.0,
      "end": 127.0,
      "text": "I have an idea."
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 127.0,
      "end": 128.0,
      "text": "Said Lausa."
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 128.0,
      "end": 132.0,
      "text": "I'll put him in the large part I use for making potions."
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 132.0,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "Maybe we can burn him up slowly."
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 135.0,
      "end": 136.0,
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 136.0,
      "end": 139.0,
      "text": "Said the Jade Emperor."
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 141.0,
      "end": 146.0,
      "text": "Soldiers brought Wukong to a room in Lausa's palace."
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 150.0,
      "text": "A large pot."
    }
  ]
}
